      "shortNotes": "Types of Vectors\n\nZero vector, unit vector, coinitial, collinear, equal, negative\n\nPosition vector: Vector from origin to point\n\nDirection Cosines and Ratios \n\nDirection cosines: l, m, n with l\u00b2 + m\u00b2 + n\u00b2 = 1\n\nIf direction ratios are a, b, c: l = \u00b1a/\u221a(a\u00b2+b\u00b2+c\u00b2), etc.\n\nDot Product \n\na \u00b7 b = |a||b|cos \u03b8\n\na \u00b7 b = a\u2081b\u2081 + a\u2082b\u2082 + a\u2083b\u2083\n\na \u00b7 b = 0 \u2192 perpendicular\n\nProjection of a on b: (a \u00b7 b)/|b|\n\nCross Product \n\na \u00d7 b = |a||b|sin \u03b8 n\u0302\n\na \u00d7 b = 0 \u2192 parallel/collinear\n\nArea of parallelogram = |a \u00d7 b|\n\nArea of triangle = \u00bd|a \u00d7 b|\n\nSection Formula \n\nInternal division: R = (mQ + nP)/(m + n)\n\nExternal division: R = (mQ \u2212 nP)/(m \u2212 n)",
